    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U06-L10-ACTIVITY-016",
      "SourceSection": "10.3: Back to Where We Started",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Here is a wheel with radius of 1 foot centered at \\((0,0)\\). What happens to point \\(P\\) if we rotate the wheel one full circle? Two full circles? 12 full circles? To someone who didn’t watch us turn the wheel, it would look like we had…",
